{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_018EitmQMakJc4vezE4aHif1","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Now I have full context. Let me synthesize the median tier predictions for all planned/preparing/running experiments.\n\n```yaml\ntier: median\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  Contribution 1 降级为 'masks are the primary factor with loss-dependent residual'。\n  C1 ablation 证实 KL oracle masks 经 BCE 训练可转移大部分质量优势，但 KL training process 本身仍贡献\n  5–15% 残余 PPL——说明 gradient coupling 对 mask decision boundary 附近 neurons 的精度仍有不可替代作用。\n  BCE@30% 与 TEAL baseline 可比（PPL 10.5 vs 10.97），gap 不够 dramatic，不支撑 'BCE fundamentally broken at all sparsity' 论断。\n  25%/35% sweep 趋势平滑无清晰 inflection point，Contribution 3 regime analysis 从 'phase transition'\n  降为 'gradual transition with identifiable operating regimes'。\n  论文措辞从 'we discover' 改为 'we identify and characterize'；\n  Abstract/Introduction 必须同时呈现 mask quality 优势和 loss-dependent residual 的 nuanced picture。\n  EMNLP Main 可行但 positioning 需精细——核心卖点转向 systematic empirical characterization + practical guideline，\n  而非 single dramatic finding。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  - name: \"c1_ablation_eval_uniform\"\n    plan_id: \"c1_ablation_eval_uniform\"\n    description: >\n      已训练的 C1 ablation predictor（BCE on KL oracle masks, c1_ablation_bce_kl_targets_s42）\n      在 50% uniform allocation 下评估 WikiText-2 PPL + oracle agreement + 4-task downstream。\n      核心实验：隔离 mask quality vs KL training dynamics 的贡献。\n    expected_results:\n      wikitext2_ppl_uniform_50pct: 10.2\n      oracle_agreement_at_forced_50pct: 0.91\n      ppl_gap_vs_kl_pertoken_pct: 10.9\n      arc_challenge_acc_norm: 0.34\n      winogrande_acc: 0.635\n      mmlu_acc: 0.275\n      gsm8k_exact_match: 0.018\n      reference_kl_pertoken_ppl: 9.2\n      reference_kl_uniform_ppl: 11.96\n      reference_standard_bce_ppl: 22.51\n    result_rationale: >\n      PPL 10.2 位于 KL per-token（9.2）和 KL uniform（11.96）之间。\n      vs KL per-token gap 10.9%：BCE training 在 neuron ranking 精度上劣于 KL——KL 的 output distribution gradient\n      为 decision boundary 附近的 marginal neurons 提供更精确的排序信号，而 BCE 的 binary cross-entropy loss\n      将 ranking 退化为 threshold classification，丢失了 rank-order 信息。\n      Oracle agreement 从自然稀疏度（0.609）的 0.978 降至 forced 50% uniform 的 0.91：\n      训练时 BCE predictor 优化的 decision threshold 针对 ~60% sparsity，forced 50% 改变了\n      每层 critical boundary，导致约 9% neurons 的 keep/prune 决策与 KL oracle 不一致。\n      这些不一致集中在 middle layers（L12-20），正是 KL 和 magnitude-based scoring 分歧最大的区域。\n      下游任务表现与 KL@50% 接近：mask quality 是 dominant factor（PPL 10.2 远优于 standard BCE 22.51），\n      但 MMLU/GSM8K 在 50% sparsity 下已趋 random baseline，mask 质量差异对 downstream 区分度有限。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table: C1 Ablation Decomposition — KL per-token / C1 ablation uniform / standard BCE / TEAL baseline @ 50%\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Bar chart: PPL decomposition showing mask-attributable vs loss-attributable quality gap\"\n    analysis: >\n      核心数据点：C1 ablation PPL 10.2 vs standard BCE 22.51 → mask quality 贡献了 KL 优势的 ~92%\n      （(22.51-10.2)/(22.51-9.2) = 0.925）。\n      剩余 ~8%（10.2 vs 9.2）来自 KL loss mechanics。\n      这支持 'masks are the primary factor' 但无法忽略 residual。\n      论文应写：'Transferring KL-discovered masks to a simpler BCE predictor recovers >90% of quality advantage,\n      confirming mask pattern quality as the dominant mechanism, while the remaining gap indicates\n      a modest but measurable contribution from the coupled training objective itself.'\n\n  - name: \"bce_30pct_standard\"\n    plan_id: \"bce_30pct_s42\"\n    description: >\n      Standard BCE predictor 在 30% sparsity（recommended operating point）训练并评估。\n      TEAL forced top-k 强制 30% 稀疏度。填补 Table 2 关键空白。\n    expected_results:\n      wikitext2_ppl_teal_global: 10.5\n      wikitext2_ppl_pertoken: 9.8\n      actual_sparsity: 0.30\n      bce_training_loss_final: 0.58\n      predictor_native_sparsity: 0.22\n      arc_challenge_acc_norm: 0.39\n      winogrande_acc: 0.66\n      mmlu_acc: 0.36\n      gsm8k_exact_match: 0.065\n      mask_divergence_vs_kl_30pct: 0.35\n      reference_kl30_uniform_ppl: 8.82\n      reference_teal30_baseline_ppl: 10.97\n    result_rationale: >\n      BCE@30% TEAL PPL 10.5，劣于 KL@30% uniform（8.82，gap 19%）但与 vanilla TEAL（10.97）差距有限（-4.3%）。\n      30% sparsity budget 足够宽松：被 prune 的 30% neurons 中大部分是 unambiguously low-activation neurons，\n      即使 BCE 的 per-neuron independent scoring 也能正确识别。KL 的额外优势集中在 marginal neurons\n      （第 28-32% 区间），这些 neurons 的重要性取决于 cross-layer interaction，BCE 的 factorized gradient\n      dL_BCE/ds_j 无法捕捉——但在 30% 时这个区间很窄，所以 absolute gap 有限。\n      BCE predictor native sparsity 预计 ~22%（低于 target 30%），与 Qwen-14B 上观察到的 BCE Lagrangian\n      sparsity collapse 现象一致（qwen14b_bce30_s42 native sparsity 6.4%）。8B 上 collapse 程度较轻\n      因为模型 activation distribution 更 well-behaved，但 BCE 仍倾向于 under-prune。\n      MMLU 0.36 接近 TEAL baseline 0.386——BCE@30% 不是灾难，而是 mediocre，\n      这削弱了 'BCE is fundamentally flawed' narrative，需要 nuanced framing：\n      'BCE performs adequately at low sparsity where decision complexity is low, but fails to scale.'\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 2 补全: 30% sparsity 行 BCE 列\"\n      - \"Pareto frontier 更新: BCE@30% point 添加\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Updated Pareto plot: BCE@30% sits near TEAL baseline, well below KL@30% Pareto frontier\"\n    analysis: >\n      BCE@30% PPL 10.5 对论文有 mixed impact。好的一面：KL@30%（8.82）仍然清晰优于 BCE（10.5），\n      优势 19% 在 statistical terms 是 meaningful 的。差的一面：BCE 并非 catastrophic（cf. 50% 时 145% gap），\n      不能简单 claim 'BCE always fails'。论文需要写：'The KL-BCE quality gap grows super-linearly with sparsity:\n      modest at 30% (19%) where most pruning decisions are unambiguous, but dramatic at 50% (145%)\n      where cross-neuron interactions become critical for mask quality.'\n\n  - name: \"kl_sparsity25_sweep\"\n    plan_id: \"kl_sparsity25_s42\"\n    description: >\n      KL predictor 训练在 25% target sparsity，WikiText-2 PPL + downstream 评估（uniform + global allocation）。\n      Regime analysis 细化采样点。\n    expected_results:\n      wikitext2_ppl_pertoken: 6.72\n      wikitext2_ppl_teal_global: 7.85\n      wikitext2_ppl_uniform: 8.15\n      actual_sparsity: 0.25\n      training_final_loss: 0.11\n      lambda_sparse_final: 5000\n      arc_challenge_acc_norm_uniform: 0.44\n      winogrande_acc_uniform: 0.72\n      mmlu_acc_uniform: 0.43\n      gsm8k_exact_match_uniform: 0.11\n      mmlu_acc_global: 0.38\n      teal_baseline_25pct_ppl: 9.5\n    result_rationale: >\n      25% sparsity 仅移除 1/4 neurons，是 deep budget-surplus regime。\n      Per-token PPL 6.72 vs dense 6.12 = +9.8%：KL predictor 在 25% 下近乎完美，\n      被 prune 的 neurons 几乎全是 near-zero activation（自然稀疏度 floor ~5% at threshold 0.1）。\n      Uniform PPL 8.15 vs 30% 的 8.82：改善 7.6% 但非 dramatic——从 30% 到 25%\n      额外保留的 5% neurons 是 moderately important 的，对 PPL 贡献边际递减。\n      MMLU uniform 0.43 vs 30% 的 0.406 = +2.4pp：在 budget-surplus regime 内，\n      downstream 差异主要来自 noise 而非 fundamental capability change，\n      3-seed 置信区间可能 overlap。\n      25% → 30% 趋势是 smooth 的（PPL: 8.15 → 8.82 = +8.2%，MMLU: 0.43 → 0.406），\n      无 inflection point——与 median tier 'no clear regime boundary' 预测一致。\n      TEAL baseline@25% ~9.5 vs KL@25% uniform 8.15：KL 优势 14%，\n      低于 30% 的 20%（8.82 vs 10.97），进一步确认 KL-TEAL gap scales with sparsity。\n    tables:\n      - \"6-point sweep table: 25% 行\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"PPL vs sparsity curve: 25% 数据点落在平滑趋势线上，无 kink\"\n    analysis: >\n      25% 数据点确认 budget-surplus regime 的 smooth 特性。\n      关键意义：与 35% 数据点合看，如果 25→30→35% 全部 smooth，则 'phase transition at 30%'\n      claim 不成立，需改写为 'operating regime with gradual transition'。\n      这对 Contribution 3 的 framing 有重大影响：\n      从 'we discover a phase transition' 降为 'we characterize operating regimes\n      and identify practical recommendations within a continuous quality-sparsity tradeoff.'\n\n  - name: \"kl_sparsity35_sweep\"\n    plan_id: \"kl_sparsity35_s42\"\n    description: >\n      KL predictor 训练在 35% target sparsity，WikiText-2 PPL + downstream 评估。\n      关键 transition zone 采样点。\n    expected_results:\n      wikitext2_ppl_pertoken: 7.95\n      wikitext2_ppl_teal_global: 9.55\n      wikitext2_ppl_uniform: 8.58\n      actual_sparsity: 0.35\n      training_final_loss: 0.19\n      arc_challenge_acc_norm_uniform: 0.42\n      winogrande_acc_uniform: 0.685\n      mmlu_acc_uniform: 0.385\n      mmlu_acc_global: 0.33\n      gsm8k_exact_match_uniform: 0.06\n    result_rationale: >\n      35% 处于 budget-surplus 到 budget-constrained 的过渡区域。\n      Uniform PPL 8.58 介于 30%（8.82）和 40%（8.36）之间但更接近 30%，\n      可能延续 PPL 非单调性（40% < 35% < 30%）——原因是更高 sparsity 迫使 predictor 更 aggressive 优化，\n      在 training 时收敛到更好的 mask quality；但 uniform allocation 在 35% 时\n      对某些 late layers 的保护效果已开始减弱（late layers 在 35% 时 retain 65%，\n      vs 30% 的 70%——这 5pp 差异落在 capacity-sensitive 的 L28-31 区间）。\n      TEAL global PPL 9.55 严格劣于 30%（8.98），呈单调递增——global allocation\n      在 35% 时开始 starve middle layers（L12-20 被分配 <30% budget），\n      但效果还不如 40%（10.12）那么严重。\n      MMLU uniform 0.385 vs 30% 的 0.406 = -2.1pp：退化 gradual，无 step change。\n      MMLU global 0.33 vs uniform 0.385 = -5.5pp：allocation sensitivity 在 35% 持续存在，\n      但比 30%（-15.3pp gap）明显缩小——因为 35% 时 per-layer budget 更紧，\n      uniform 的 'equal protection' 优势被 capacity constraint 部分抵消。\n    tables:\n      - \"6-point sweep table: 35% 行\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Allocation preference plot: uniform-vs-global delta at 25/30/35/40/50%, 显示 crossover 是 gradual\"\n    analysis: >\n      35% 是 median tier 预测的关键检验：如果 25→30→35% 趋势全部 smooth，\n      则 'phase transition' framing 必须放弃。\n      结合 40% 数据（uniform MMLU 0.307 vs global 0.381 = global wins），\n      uniform→global crossover 发生在 35-40% 之间但是 gradual 的。\n      论文应写：'The allocation preference transitions gradually between 30-40% sparsity:\n      uniform allocation is preferred below ~35%, learned global allocation becomes valuable above ~38%,\n      with a broad crossover zone rather than a sharp phase boundary.'\n      这个 finding 仍然 publishable（practical deployment guideline），但叙事张力弱于 'phase transition'。\n\n  - name: \"longbench_all_conditions\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_010\"\n    description: >\n      LongBench English subset (4K-32K) 全条件评估：dense, KL@30% uniform, KL@50% global,\n      TEAL@30%, TEAL@50%。Per-task breakdown: single-doc QA, multi-doc QA, summarization。\n    expected_results:\n      dense_narrativeqa: 18.5\n      dense_qasper: 28.0\n      dense_multifieldqa: 35.0\n      dense_gov_report: 30.5\n      dense_multi_news: 25.0\n      kl30_uniform_narrativeqa: 14.0\n      kl30_uniform_qasper: 21.0\n      kl30_uniform_multifieldqa: 26.5\n      kl30_uniform_gov_report: 23.5\n      kl30_uniform_multi_news: 19.5\n      kl30_uniform_avg_retention_vs_dense: 0.75\n      kl50_global_narrativeqa: 7.8\n      kl50_global_qasper: 12.0\n      kl50_global_avg_retention_vs_dense: 0.42\n      teal30_narrativeqa: 11.5\n      teal30_qasper: 16.5\n      teal30_avg_retention_vs_dense: 0.60\n      teal50_narrativeqa: 4.2\n      teal50_qasper: 6.0\n      teal50_avg_retention_vs_dense: 0.22\n    result_rationale: >\n      Predictor 在 2048-token sequences 上训练，LongBench 输入 4K-32K 构成 distribution shift。\n      KL@30% uniform retention 75%：per-token neuron importance predictions 对 local context 仍有效\n      （FFN 主要处理 local features），但 long-range dependency integration 依赖的 middle-layer neurons\n      可能被误判——predictor 未见过 32K 输入的 attention pattern，导致 layers L12-20 的\n      mask quality 退化约 10-15%。\n      Summarization tasks（gov_report）retention 相对较高（77%）因为 summarization\n      主要依赖 global topic understanding 而非 precise retrieval——topic-relevant neurons\n      在短 context 中也 active，predictor 可泛化。\n      QA tasks（narrativeqa, qasper）退化更多（~73% retention）因为 precise answer extraction\n      需要 context-dependent neuron activation patterns 在 long context 中会 shift。\n      KL vs TEAL 差距在 LongBench 缩小（75% vs 60% retention）：\n      TEAL 的 magnitude-based scoring 对 context length 不敏感（static importance），\n      而 KL predictor 的 contextual advantage 在 distribution shift 下部分失效。\n      NOTE: 之前 v1-v5 全部 failed，v6 partial results 偏低（dense narrativeqa 7.3）。\n      本预测假设 evaluation pipeline fully fixed，dense baseline 回到合理范围。\n      如果实际 dense baseline 仍异常低，需先修 pipeline 才有 interpretable results。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table: LongBench per-task x condition matrix\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Heatmap: tasks (rows) x conditions (cols), color = retention vs dense\"\n      - \"Bar chart: KL vs TEAL advantage ratio at different context length buckets\"\n    analysis: >\n      LongBench 对 paper 的主要贡献是展示 predictor 的 generalization boundary。\n      75% retention@30% 是 reasonable——足以 claim 'KL predictor generalizes to longer contexts\n      with moderate degradation'，但不足以 claim 'no degradation'。\n      TEAL 差距缩小是 median tier 的 key nuance：在 long context 上 KL 优势缩水，\n      暗示 predictor 的 context-dependent scoring 在 OOD 长度上价值递减。\n      这是一个 honest limitation，论文应在 Discussion 中 acknowledge。\n\n  - name: \"mt_bench_all_conditions\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_011\"\n    description: >\n      MT-Bench 80 multi-turn questions × GPT-4o judge。Dense, KL@30% uniform, KL@50% global, TEAL@30%。\n      P2 priority，在 median tier 下可能因 GPU/API budget 限制不实际运行。\n    expected_results:\n      dense_overall: 7.1\n      dense_writing: 7.8\n      dense_roleplay: 7.5\n      dense_reasoning: 5.5\n      dense_math: 4.2\n      dense_coding: 5.8\n      dense_extraction: 7.0\n      dense_stem: 8.0\n      dense_humanities: 8.5\n      kl30_uniform_overall: 5.8\n      kl30_uniform_writing: 6.5\n      kl30_uniform_reasoning: 4.0\n      kl30_uniform_math: 2.5\n      kl30_uniform_coding: 4.0\n      kl50_global_overall: 3.8\n      kl50_global_writing: 4.5\n      kl50_global_reasoning: 2.2\n      teal30_overall: 5.0\n      teal30_writing: 5.8\n    result_rationale: >\n      MT-Bench 测试 open-ended generation quality，对 fluency 和 instruction adherence 敏感。\n      Dense Llama-3.1-8B overall ~7.1（基于 public benchmarks 已知范围 6.5-7.5）。\n      KL@30% overall 5.8（retention 82%）：writing/humanities 保持较好（依赖 fluency，\n      sparsity 对 next-token distribution 的影响在 high-frequency tokens 上较小），\n      math/coding 退化最多（精确计算和逻辑推理依赖 specific neuron pathways，\n      30% pruning 虽温和但对 chain-of-thought 过程中的 intermediate computation 有累积影响）。\n      TEAL@30% overall 5.0 vs KL@30% 5.8 = +0.8 差异：\n      GPT-4o judge 对 subtle fluency 差异的区分度有限（judge 更关注 correctness 和 completeness），\n      所以 MT-Bench 上 KL-TEAL gap 比 PPL gap（19%）更小。\n      KL@50% overall 3.8：multi-turn conversation 在 50% sparsity 下严重退化，\n      第二轮回复几乎 incoherent（model capacity 不足以 maintain context across turns）。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table: MT-Bench 8-category scores for dense / KL@30% / TEAL@30%\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Radar chart: 8 categories × 3 conditions\"\n    analysis: >\n      MT-Bench 差异（KL 5.8 vs TEAL 5.0 = +0.8）在 typical MT-Bench variance（per-category std ~0.3-0.5）下\n      可能 borderline significant。如果 3+ categories 的差异达到 >1.0，可在正文报告。\n      如果差异 <0.5 on average，降为 Appendix supplementary evidence。\n      P2 priority + API cost 意味着 median tier 下这个实验可能被 skip——\n      如果 skip，论文可在 Limitations 中写 'instruction-following evaluation (MT-Bench) deferred to future work'。\n\n  - name: \"ruler_synthetic_long_context\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_012\"\n    description: >\n      RULER synthetic evaluation at 4K/16K context × 3 tasks: NIAH, Variable Tracking, Common Words。\n      P2 priority，depends on plan_010。\n    expected_results:\n      dense_4k_niah: 0.95\n      dense_16k_niah: 0.88\n      dense_4k_vt: 0.72\n      dense_16k_vt: 0.55\n      dense_4k_cw: 0.85\n      dense_16k_cw: 0.78\n      kl30_4k_niah: 0.88\n      kl30_16k_niah: 0.72\n      kl30_4k_vt: 0.58\n      kl30_16k_vt: 0.38\n      kl30_4k_cw: 0.78\n      kl30_16k_cw: 0.62\n      kl30_avg_retention_4k: 0.89\n      kl30_avg_retention_16k: 0.78\n    result_rationale: >\n      RULER 的 synthetic tasks 提供 controlled diagnostic，与 LongBench 的 naturalistic tasks 互补。\n      NIAH 测试 precise retrieval：sparsity 通过 pruning attention-critical FFN neurons\n      影响 retrieval precision，4K 上 retention 93%（predictor 训练长度 2048 接近 4K），\n      16K 退化到 82%（2× OOD 长度，neuron importance distribution shift 更大）。\n      Variable Tracking 最 sensitive（需 maintain state across many tokens）：\n      从 0.72→0.58 (4K) 和 0.55→0.38 (16K)——cumulative errors from imperfect masks\n      在 multi-step tracking 中 compound。\n      4K retention 89% vs 16K 78%：退化 gradient ~11pp per 4× length increase，\n      consistent with 'predictor generalizes to ~2× training length, degrades gracefully beyond'。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table: RULER 3-task × 2-length × conditions\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Line plot: accuracy vs context length (4K/16K) per task, KL vs TEAL vs Dense\"\n    analysis: >\n      RULER 是 P2，depends on plan_010（LongBench）。如果 LongBench pipeline issues 未解决，\n      RULER 也无法运行。Median tier 下最可能 outcome：plan_010 partially succeeds，\n      plan_012 被 deprioritized。\n      如果运行，RULER 的 controlled tasks 可以 cleanly quantify length-generalization degradation，\n      补充 LongBench 的 noisy naturalistic results。\n      论文策略：RULER 结果放 Appendix，LongBench 在正文。\n```\n\n7 个实验预测完毕。核心 takeaway：\n\n- **C1 ablation** (PPL 10.2 vs KL 9.2 = 11% gap) 是最关键数据点，决定 Contribution 1 的 framing 强度。>90% 的 KL 优势可归因于 mask quality，但 residual 不可忽视。\n- **BCE@30%** (PPL 10.5) 与 TEAL baseline 可比，削弱 'BCE fundamentally broken' 叙事，需要 sparsity-dependent framing。\n- **25%/35% sweep** 趋势 smooth，无 clear inflection point，Contribution 3 需降级为 'gradual regime characterization'。\n- **LongBench/MT-Bench/RULER** 均为 P1/P2，median tier 下 LongBench 有望完成但结果中等（75% retention@30%），MT-Bench 和 RULER 可能被 skip。"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":72,"cache_read_input_tokens":76366,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":72},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"57ec3bdf-f5cc-4a3b-a1a6-8977a503c16e","uuid":"3c90c622-fb66-48dd-b008-64793e900e40"}
{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"api_error_status":null,"duration_ms":587195,"duration_api_ms":589185,"num_turns":5,"result":"Now I have full context. Let me synthesize the median tier predictions for all planned/preparing/running experiments.\n\n```yaml\ntier: median\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  Contribution 1 降级为 'masks are the primary factor with loss-dependent residual'。\n  C1 ablation 证实 KL oracle masks 经 BCE 训练可转移大部分质量优势，但 KL training process 本身仍贡献\n  5–15% 残余 PPL——说明 gradient coupling 对 mask decision boundary 附近 neurons 的精度仍有不可替代作用。\n  BCE@30% 与 TEAL baseline 可比（PPL 10.5 vs 10.97），gap 不够 dramatic，不支撑 'BCE fundamentally broken at all sparsity' 论断。\n  25%/35% sweep 趋势平滑无清晰 inflection point，Contribution 3 regime analysis 从 'phase transition'\n  降为 'gradual transition with identifiable operating regimes'。\n  论文措辞从 'we discover' 改为 'we identify and characterize'；\n  Abstract/Introduction 必须同时呈现 mask quality 优势和 loss-dependent residual 的 nuanced picture。\n  EMNLP Main 可行但 positioning 需精细——核心卖点转向 systematic empirical characterization + practical guideline，\n  而非 single dramatic finding。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  - name: \"c1_ablation_eval_uniform\"\n    plan_id: \"c1_ablation_eval_uniform\"\n    description: >\n      已训练的 C1 ablation predictor（BCE on KL oracle masks, c1_ablation_bce_kl_targets_s42）\n      在 50% uniform allocation 下评估 WikiText-2 PPL + oracle agreement + 4-task downstream。\n      核心实验：隔离 mask quality vs KL training dynamics 的贡献。\n    expected_results:\n      wikitext2_ppl_uniform_50pct: 10.2\n      oracle_agreement_at_forced_50pct: 0.91\n      ppl_gap_vs_kl_pertoken_pct: 10.9\n      arc_challenge_acc_norm: 0.34\n      winogrande_acc: 0.635\n      mmlu_acc: 0.275\n      gsm8k_exact_match: 0.018\n      reference_kl_pertoken_ppl: 9.2\n      reference_kl_uniform_ppl: 11.96\n      reference_standard_bce_ppl: 22.51\n    result_rationale: >\n      PPL 10.2 位于 KL per-token（9.2）和 KL uniform（11.96）之间。\n      vs KL per-token gap 10.9%：BCE training 在 neuron ranking 精度上劣于 KL——KL 的 output distribution gradient\n      为 decision boundary 附近的 marginal neurons 提供更精确的排序信号，而 BCE 的 binary cross-entropy loss\n      将 ranking 退化为 threshold classification，丢失了 rank-order 信息。\n      Oracle agreement 从自然稀疏度（0.609）的 0.978 降至 forced 50% uniform 的 0.91：\n      训练时 BCE predictor 优化的 decision threshold 针对 ~60% sparsity，forced 50% 改变了\n      每层 critical boundary，导致约 9% neurons 的 keep/prune 决策与 KL oracle 不一致。\n      这些不一致集中在 middle layers（L12-20），正是 KL 和 magnitude-based scoring 分歧最大的区域。\n      下游任务表现与 KL@50% 接近：mask quality 是 dominant factor（PPL 10.2 远优于 standard BCE 22.51），\n      但 MMLU/GSM8K 在 50% sparsity 下已趋 random baseline，mask 质量差异对 downstream 区分度有限。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table: C1 Ablation Decomposition — KL per-token / C1 ablation uniform / standard BCE / TEAL baseline @ 50%\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Bar chart: PPL decomposition showing mask-attributable vs loss-attributable quality gap\"\n    analysis: >\n      核心数据点：C1 ablation PPL 10.2 vs standard BCE 22.51 → mask quality 贡献了 KL 优势的 ~92%\n      （(22.51-10.2)/(22.51-9.2) = 0.925）。\n      剩余 ~8%（10.2 vs 9.2）来自 KL loss mechanics。\n      这支持 'masks are the primary factor' 但无法忽略 residual。\n      论文应写：'Transferring KL-discovered masks to a simpler BCE predictor recovers >90% of quality advantage,\n      confirming mask pattern quality as the dominant mechanism, while the remaining gap indicates\n      a modest but measurable contribution from the coupled training objective itself.'\n\n  - name: \"bce_30pct_standard\"\n    plan_id: \"bce_30pct_s42\"\n    description: >\n      Standard BCE predictor 在 30% sparsity（recommended operating point）训练并评估。\n      TEAL forced top-k 强制 30% 稀疏度。填补 Table 2 关键空白。\n    expected_results:\n      wikitext2_ppl_teal_global: 10.5\n      wikitext2_ppl_pertoken: 9.8\n      actual_sparsity: 0.30\n      bce_training_loss_final: 0.58\n      predictor_native_sparsity: 0.22\n      arc_challenge_acc_norm: 0.39\n      winogrande_acc: 0.66\n      mmlu_acc: 0.36\n      gsm8k_exact_match: 0.065\n      mask_divergence_vs_kl_30pct: 0.35\n      reference_kl30_uniform_ppl: 8.82\n      reference_teal30_baseline_ppl: 10.97\n    result_rationale: >\n      BCE@30% TEAL PPL 10.5，劣于 KL@30% uniform（8.82，gap 19%）但与 vanilla TEAL（10.97）差距有限（-4.3%）。\n      30% sparsity budget 足够宽松：被 prune 的 30% neurons 中大部分是 unambiguously low-activation neurons，\n      即使 BCE 的 per-neuron independent scoring 也能正确识别。KL 的额外优势集中在 marginal neurons\n      （第 28-32% 区间），这些 neurons 的重要性取决于 cross-layer interaction，BCE 的 factorized gradient\n      dL_BCE/ds_j 无法捕捉——但在 30% 时这个区间很窄，所以 absolute gap 有限。\n      BCE predictor native sparsity 预计 ~22%（低于 target 30%），与 Qwen-14B 上观察到的 BCE Lagrangian\n      sparsity collapse 现象一致（qwen14b_bce30_s42 native sparsity 6.4%）。8B 上 collapse 程度较轻\n      因为模型 activation distribution 更 well-behaved，但 BCE 仍倾向于 under-prune。\n      MMLU 0.36 接近 TEAL baseline 0.386——BCE@30% 不是灾难，而是 mediocre，\n      这削弱了 'BCE is fundamentally flawed' narrative，需要 nuanced framing：\n      'BCE performs adequately at low sparsity where decision complexity is low, but fails to scale.'\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 2 补全: 30% sparsity 行 BCE 列\"\n      - \"Pareto frontier 更新: BCE@30% point 添加\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Updated Pareto plot: BCE@30% sits near TEAL baseline, well below KL@30% Pareto frontier\"\n    analysis: >\n      BCE@30% PPL 10.5 对论文有 mixed impact。好的一面：KL@30%（8.82）仍然清晰优于 BCE（10.5），\n      优势 19% 在 statistical terms 是 meaningful 的。差的一面：BCE 并非 catastrophic（cf. 50% 时 145% gap），\n      不能简单 claim 'BCE always fails'。论文需要写：'The KL-BCE quality gap grows super-linearly with sparsity:\n      modest at 30% (19%) where most pruning decisions are unambiguous, but dramatic at 50% (145%)\n      where cross-neuron interactions become critical for mask quality.'\n\n  - name: \"kl_sparsity25_sweep\"\n    plan_id: \"kl_sparsity25_s42\"\n    description: >\n      KL predictor 训练在 25% target sparsity，WikiText-2 PPL + downstream 评估（uniform + global allocation）。\n      Regime analysis 细化采样点。\n    expected_results:\n      wikitext2_ppl_pertoken: 6.72\n      wikitext2_ppl_teal_global: 7.85\n      wikitext2_ppl_uniform: 8.15\n      actual_sparsity: 0.25\n      training_final_loss: 0.11\n      lambda_sparse_final: 5000\n      arc_challenge_acc_norm_uniform: 0.44\n      winogrande_acc_uniform: 0.72\n      mmlu_acc_uniform: 0.43\n      gsm8k_exact_match_uniform: 0.11\n      mmlu_acc_global: 0.38\n      teal_baseline_25pct_ppl: 9.5\n    result_rationale: >\n      25% sparsity 仅移除 1/4 neurons，是 deep budget-surplus regime。\n      Per-token PPL 6.72 vs dense 6.12 = +9.8%：KL predictor 在 25% 下近乎完美，\n      被 prune 的 neurons 几乎全是 near-zero activation（自然稀疏度 floor ~5% at threshold 0.1）。\n      Uniform PPL 8.15 vs 30% 的 8.82：改善 7.6% 但非 dramatic——从 30% 到 25%\n      额外保留的 5% neurons 是 moderately important 的，对 PPL 贡献边际递减。\n      MMLU uniform 0.43 vs 30% 的 0.406 = +2.4pp：在 budget-surplus regime 内，\n      downstream 差异主要来自 noise 而非 fundamental capability change，\n      3-seed 置信区间可能 overlap。\n      25% → 30% 趋势是 smooth 的（PPL: 8.15 → 8.82 = +8.2%，MMLU: 0.43 → 0.406），\n      无 inflection point——与 median tier 'no clear regime boundary' 预测一致。\n      TEAL baseline@25% ~9.5 vs KL@25% uniform 8.15：KL 优势 14%，\n      低于 30% 的 20%（8.82 vs 10.97），进一步确认 KL-TEAL gap scales with sparsity。\n    tables:\n      - \"6-point sweep table: 25% 行\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"PPL vs sparsity curve: 25% 数据点落在平滑趋势线上，无 kink\"\n    analysis: >\n      25% 数据点确认 budget-surplus regime 的 smooth 特性。\n      关键意义：与 35% 数据点合看，如果 25→30→35% 全部 smooth，则 'phase transition at 30%'\n      claim 不成立，需改写为 'operating regime with gradual transition'。\n      这对 Contribution 3 的 framing 有重大影响：\n      从 'we discover a phase transition' 降为 'we characterize operating regimes\n      and identify practical recommendations within a continuous quality-sparsity tradeoff.'\n\n  - name: \"kl_sparsity35_sweep\"\n    plan_id: \"kl_sparsity35_s42\"\n    description: >\n      KL predictor 训练在 35% target sparsity，WikiText-2 PPL + downstream 评估。\n      关键 transition zone 采样点。\n    expected_results:\n      wikitext2_ppl_pertoken: 7.95\n      wikitext2_ppl_teal_global: 9.55\n      wikitext2_ppl_uniform: 8.58\n      actual_sparsity: 0.35\n      training_final_loss: 0.19\n      arc_challenge_acc_norm_uniform: 0.42\n      winogrande_acc_uniform: 0.685\n      mmlu_acc_uniform: 0.385\n      mmlu_acc_global: 0.33\n      gsm8k_exact_match_uniform: 0.06\n    result_rationale: >\n      35% 处于 budget-surplus 到 budget-constrained 的过渡区域。\n      Uniform PPL 8.58 介于 30%（8.82）和 40%（8.36）之间但更接近 30%，\n      可能延续 PPL 非单调性（40% < 35% < 30%）——原因是更高 sparsity 迫使 predictor 更 aggressive 优化，\n      在 training 时收敛到更好的 mask quality；但 uniform allocation 在 35% 时\n      对某些 late layers 的保护效果已开始减弱（late layers 在 35% 时 retain 65%，\n      vs 30% 的 70%——这 5pp 差异落在 capacity-sensitive 的 L28-31 区间）。\n      TEAL global PPL 9.55 严格劣于 30%（8.98），呈单调递增——global allocation\n      在 35% 时开始 starve middle layers（L12-20 被分配 <30% budget），\n      但效果还不如 40%（10.12）那么严重。\n      MMLU uniform 0.385 vs 30% 的 0.406 = -2.1pp：退化 gradual，无 step change。\n      MMLU global 0.33 vs uniform 0.385 = -5.5pp：allocation sensitivity 在 35% 持续存在，\n      但比 30%（-15.3pp gap）明显缩小——因为 35% 时 per-layer budget 更紧，\n      uniform 的 'equal protection' 优势被 capacity constraint 部分抵消。\n    tables:\n      - \"6-point sweep table: 35% 行\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Allocation preference plot: uniform-vs-global delta at 25/30/35/40/50%, 显示 crossover 是 gradual\"\n    analysis: >\n      35% 是 median tier 预测的关键检验：如果 25→30→35% 趋势全部 smooth，\n      则 'phase transition' framing 必须放弃。\n      结合 40% 数据（uniform MMLU 0.307 vs global 0.381 = global wins），\n      uniform→global crossover 发生在 35-40% 之间但是 gradual 的。\n      论文应写：'The allocation preference transitions gradually between 30-40% sparsity:\n      uniform allocation is preferred below ~35%, learned global allocation becomes valuable above ~38%,\n      with a broad crossover zone rather than a sharp phase boundary.'\n      这个 finding 仍然 publishable（practical deployment guideline），但叙事张力弱于 'phase transition'。\n\n  - name: \"longbench_all_conditions\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_010\"\n    description: >\n      LongBench English subset (4K-32K) 全条件评估：dense, KL@30% uniform, KL@50% global,\n      TEAL@30%, TEAL@50%。Per-task breakdown: single-doc QA, multi-doc QA, summarization。\n    expected_results:\n      dense_narrativeqa: 18.5\n      dense_qasper: 28.0\n      dense_multifieldqa: 35.0\n      dense_gov_report: 30.5\n      dense_multi_news: 25.0\n      kl30_uniform_narrativeqa: 14.0\n      kl30_uniform_qasper: 21.0\n      kl30_uniform_multifieldqa: 26.5\n      kl30_uniform_gov_report: 23.5\n      kl30_uniform_multi_news: 19.5\n      kl30_uniform_avg_retention_vs_dense: 0.75\n      kl50_global_narrativeqa: 7.8\n      kl50_global_qasper: 12.0\n      kl50_global_avg_retention_vs_dense: 0.42\n      teal30_narrativeqa: 11.5\n      teal30_qasper: 16.5\n      teal30_avg_retention_vs_dense: 0.60\n      teal50_narrativeqa: 4.2\n      teal50_qasper: 6.0\n      teal50_avg_retention_vs_dense: 0.22\n    result_rationale: >\n      Predictor 在 2048-token sequences 上训练，LongBench 输入 4K-32K 构成 distribution shift。\n      KL@30% uniform retention 75%：per-token neuron importance predictions 对 local context 仍有效\n      （FFN 主要处理 local features），但 long-range dependency integration 依赖的 middle-layer neurons\n      可能被误判——predictor 未见过 32K 输入的 attention pattern，导致 layers L12-20 的\n      mask quality 退化约 10-15%。\n      Summarization tasks（gov_report）retention 相对较高（77%）因为 summarization\n      主要依赖 global topic understanding 而非 precise retrieval——topic-relevant neurons\n      在短 context 中也 active，predictor 可泛化。\n      QA tasks（narrativeqa, qasper）退化更多（~73% retention）因为 precise answer extraction\n      需要 context-dependent neuron activation patterns 在 long context 中会 shift。\n      KL vs TEAL 差距在 LongBench 缩小（75% vs 60% retention）：\n      TEAL 的 magnitude-based scoring 对 context length 不敏感（static importance），\n      而 KL predictor 的 contextual advantage 在 distribution shift 下部分失效。\n      NOTE: 之前 v1-v5 全部 failed，v6 partial results 偏低（dense narrativeqa 7.3）。\n      本预测假设 evaluation pipeline fully fixed，dense baseline 回到合理范围。\n      如果实际 dense baseline 仍异常低，需先修 pipeline 才有 interpretable results。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table: LongBench per-task x condition matrix\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Heatmap: tasks (rows) x conditions (cols), color = retention vs dense\"\n      - \"Bar chart: KL vs TEAL advantage ratio at different context length buckets\"\n    analysis: >\n      LongBench 对 paper 的主要贡献是展示 predictor 的 generalization boundary。\n      75% retention@30% 是 reasonable——足以 claim 'KL predictor generalizes to longer contexts\n      with moderate degradation'，但不足以 claim 'no degradation'。\n      TEAL 差距缩小是 median tier 的 key nuance：在 long context 上 KL 优势缩水，\n      暗示 predictor 的 context-dependent scoring 在 OOD 长度上价值递减。\n      这是一个 honest limitation，论文应在 Discussion 中 acknowledge。\n\n  - name: \"mt_bench_all_conditions\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_011\"\n    description: >\n      MT-Bench 80 multi-turn questions × GPT-4o judge。Dense, KL@30% uniform, KL@50% global, TEAL@30%。\n      P2 priority，在 median tier 下可能因 GPU/API budget 限制不实际运行。\n    expected_results:\n      dense_overall: 7.1\n      dense_writing: 7.8\n      dense_roleplay: 7.5\n      dense_reasoning: 5.5\n      dense_math: 4.2\n      dense_coding: 5.8\n      dense_extraction: 7.0\n      dense_stem: 8.0\n      dense_humanities: 8.5\n      kl30_uniform_overall: 5.8\n      kl30_uniform_writing: 6.5\n      kl30_uniform_reasoning: 4.0\n      kl30_uniform_math: 2.5\n      kl30_uniform_coding: 4.0\n      kl50_global_overall: 3.8\n      kl50_global_writing: 4.5\n      kl50_global_reasoning: 2.2\n      teal30_overall: 5.0\n      teal30_writing: 5.8\n    result_rationale: >\n      MT-Bench 测试 open-ended generation quality，对 fluency 和 instruction adherence 敏感。\n      Dense Llama-3.1-8B overall ~7.1（基于 public benchmarks 已知范围 6.5-7.5）。\n      KL@30% overall 5.8（retention 82%）：writing/humanities 保持较好（依赖 fluency，\n      sparsity 对 next-token distribution 的影响在 high-frequency tokens 上较小），\n      math/coding 退化最多（精确计算和逻辑推理依赖 specific neuron pathways，\n      30% pruning 虽温和但对 chain-of-thought 过程中的 intermediate computation 有累积影响）。\n      TEAL@30% overall 5.0 vs KL@30% 5.8 = +0.8 差异：\n      GPT-4o judge 对 subtle fluency 差异的区分度有限（judge 更关注 correctness 和 completeness），\n      所以 MT-Bench 上 KL-TEAL gap 比 PPL gap（19%）更小。\n      KL@50% overall 3.8：multi-turn conversation 在 50% sparsity 下严重退化，\n      第二轮回复几乎 incoherent（model capacity 不足以 maintain context across turns）。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table: MT-Bench 8-category scores for dense / KL@30% / TEAL@30%\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Radar chart: 8 categories × 3 conditions\"\n    analysis: >\n      MT-Bench 差异（KL 5.8 vs TEAL 5.0 = +0.8）在 typical MT-Bench variance（per-category std ~0.3-0.5）下\n      可能 borderline significant。如果 3+ categories 的差异达到 >1.0，可在正文报告。\n      如果差异 <0.5 on average，降为 Appendix supplementary evidence。\n      P2 priority + API cost 意味着 median tier 下这个实验可能被 skip——\n      如果 skip，论文可在 Limitations 中写 'instruction-following evaluation (MT-Bench) deferred to future work'。\n\n  - name: \"ruler_synthetic_long_context\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_012\"\n    description: >\n      RULER synthetic evaluation at 4K/16K context × 3 tasks: NIAH, Variable Tracking, Common Words。\n      P2 priority，depends on plan_010。\n    expected_results:\n      dense_4k_niah: 0.95\n      dense_16k_niah: 0.88\n      dense_4k_vt: 0.72\n      dense_16k_vt: 0.55\n      dense_4k_cw: 0.85\n      dense_16k_cw: 0.78\n      kl30_4k_niah: 0.88\n      kl30_16k_niah: 0.72\n      kl30_4k_vt: 0.58\n      kl30_16k_vt: 0.38\n      kl30_4k_cw: 0.78\n      kl30_16k_cw: 0.62\n      kl30_avg_retention_4k: 0.89\n      kl30_avg_retention_16k: 0.78\n    result_rationale: >\n      RULER 的 synthetic tasks 提供 controlled diagnostic，与 LongBench 的 naturalistic tasks 互补。\n      NIAH 测试 precise retrieval：sparsity 通过 pruning attention-critical FFN neurons\n      影响 retrieval precision，4K 上 retention 93%（predictor 训练长度 2048 接近 4K），\n      16K 退化到 82%（2× OOD 长度，neuron importance distribution shift 更大）。\n      Variable Tracking 最 sensitive（需 maintain state across many tokens）：\n      从 0.72→0.58 (4K) 和 0.55→0.38 (16K)——cumulative errors from imperfect masks\n      在 multi-step tracking 中 compound。\n      4K retention 89% vs 16K 78%：退化 gradient ~11pp per 4× length increase，\n      consistent with 'predictor generalizes to ~2× training length, degrades gracefully beyond'。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table: RULER 3-task × 2-length × conditions\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Line plot: accuracy vs context length (4K/16K) per task, KL vs TEAL vs Dense\"\n    analysis: >\n      RULER 是 P2，depends on plan_010（LongBench）。如果 LongBench pipeline issues 未解决，\n      RULER 也无法运行。Median tier 下最可能 outcome：plan_010 partially succeeds，\n      plan_012 被 deprioritized。\n      如果运行，RULER 的 controlled tasks 可以 cleanly quantify length-generalization degradation，\n      补充 LongBench 的 noisy naturalistic results。\n      论文策略：RULER 结果放 Appendix，LongBench 在正文。\n```\n\n7 个实验预测完毕。核心 takeaway：\n\n- **C1 ablation** (PPL 10.2 vs KL 9.2 = 11% gap) 是最关键数据点，决定 Contribution 1 的 framing 强度。>90% 的 KL 优势可归因于 mask quality，但 residual 不可忽视。\n- **BCE@30%** (PPL 10.5) 与 TEAL baseline 可比，削弱 'BCE fundamentally broken' 叙事，需要 sparsity-dependent framing。\n- **25%/35% sweep** 趋势 smooth，无 clear inflection point，Contribution 3 需降级为 'gradual regime characterization'。\n- **LongBench/MT-Bench/RULER** 均为 P1/P2，median tier 下 LongBench 有望完成但结果中等（75% retention@30%），MT-Bench 和 RULER 可能被 skip。","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"57ec3bdf-f5cc-4a3b-a1a6-8977a503c16e","total_cost_usd":1.29153025,"usage":{"input_tokens":6,"cache_creation_input_tokens":64597,"cache_read_input_tokens":277132,"output_tokens":28793,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":64597,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":1,"output_tokens":7319,"cache_read_input_tokens":76366,"cache_creation_input_tokens":72,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":72},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":29278,"outputTokens":20,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":0,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.029377999999999998,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000},"claude-opus-4-6":{"inputTokens":6,"outputTokens":28793,"cacheReadInputTokens":277132,"cacheCreationInputTokens":64597,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":1.26215225,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":64000}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","uuid":"3a2174bc-5cf2-4a90-b142-e494ecc5b0a3"}
